                                       &lt;p&gt;Then, download the printer driver=
 from the official page.=0A                                                =
                    &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                =
                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                       =
             &lt;p&gt;Next, double-tap the downloaded file.&lt;/p&gt;=0A               =
