                                              &lt;li&gt;=0A                      =
                                              &lt;p&gt;Now, you have to complete =
the installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                =
                &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                    =
                &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A        =
                                                        &lt;/li&gt;=0A           =
                                                     &lt;li&gt;=0A               =
                                                     &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run dialo=
gue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                     =
           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                         =
           &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinters=
.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                              =
      &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                              =
  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;=
li&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;=
p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                  =
